@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+URI.DefaultScheme
+TYPE: string
+DEFAULT: 'http'
+--DESCRIPTION--
+
+<p>
+    Defines through what scheme the output will be served, in order to 
+    select the proper object validator when no scheme information is present.
+</p>
+
